## Why This Is Asked
This tests end-to-end basics of GCP ingestion, idempotence, and simple routing for a beginner in a cloud environment.

## Key Concepts
- HTTPS Cloud Functions
- Cloud Storage-based dedup (simple state)
- Pub/Sub messaging
- Cloud Run and BigQuery write
- IAM least-privilege and retries

## Code Example
```javascript
// Minimal Cloud Function skeleton
exports.ingestEvent = async (req, res) => {
  const payload = req.body;
  if (!payload || !payload.clientEventId) { res.status(400).end(); return; }
  // dedup check would occur here
  res.status(202).end();
};
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you make dedup robust under high concurrency?
- What observability would you add to detect failures?

